    '|a||Lost and found in Russian: исчезла, нашлась, оказалось':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5640
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||The medal disappears from the wall at «Нева» and turns up again: lost, found, disappeared, turned up and it turned out that, in Russian.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:s4bqzq'
    '|a||Май. Ме́сяц наза́д мы победи́ли на ко́нкурсе, и тепе́рь в «Неве́» на стене́ виси́т на́ша меда́ль.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8000
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Меда́ль: a medal.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:104hd9x'
    '|a||Но сего́дня у́тром на ку́хню прихо́дит Ка́тя, наш администра́тор. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1dc9oa6'
    '|b||Том, где меда́ль? Она́ висе́ла здесь, на стене́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3640
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:rfz5t'
    '|a||Не зна́ю. Вчера́ она́ была́ здесь. Куда́ она́ пропа́ла?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5040
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Я везде́ иска́ла. Она́ исче́зла!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Ви́димо, кто́-то взял её отсю́да.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2840
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Подожди́… Ди́ма пи́шет! Оказа́лось, что он взял её домо́й, показа́ть ма́ме.':
