      ms: 1360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Что вы услы́шали? Она́ исче́зла: it disappeared. Куда́ она́ пропа́ла: where has it gone?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Он исче́з, она́ исче́зла: no л for him. Он пропа́л, она́ пропа́ла.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:y68248'
    '|a||Я везде́ иска́ла: everywhere. Ка́те стано́вится стра́шно.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1kruc22'
    '|a||Ви́димо, кто́-то взял её отсю́да. Ви́димо: apparently. Отсю́да: from here.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:5fioaj'
    '|a||А отту́да: from there. Мы е́дем отту́да, из Москвы́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:e8wmto'
    '|a||Оказа́лось, что он взял её домо́й. Оказа́лось, что: it turned out that.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:co9ls4'
    '|a||Хорошо́, что она́ нашла́сь: it turned up. Найти́ with -ся, in the -ся colour of lesson 142.':
