      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1l5qqsy'
    '|a||Потеря́ть, найти́: you know them from lesson 117. Я потеря́л, я нашёл.':
