      ms: 5640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ziw6h3'
    '|a||Пропа́сть, найти́сь: the everyday pair. Меда́ль пропа́ла, меда́ль нашла́сь.':
