      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:opz6vc'
    '|a||Back: найти́, появи́ться, найти́сь. Повтори́те вслух.':
